**/*.rs.bk

# The DELTA-ONLY spec doctrine (gen `fleet-migrate`): commit the slim
# `Cargo.gen.lock` delta, retire the full `Cargo.build-spec.json`.
#
# Both are IFD-free once committed — substrate's `lockfile-delta.nix`
# reconstructs a BuildSpec-shaped attrset from the delta plus the lock-owned
# half derived in PURE NIX from Cargo.lock/Cargo.toml, so the output shape is
# identical to the full spec and the whole downstream ladder is unchanged.
# The delta is simply the smaller committed artifact.
#
# `gen build` writes BOTH; only the delta is tracked. Same posture as mirante
# (.gitignore:17) and the rest of the migrated fleet.
Cargo.build-spec.json
